Dreams are just a spark away!

2
00:07:34,736 --> 00:07:40,736
Monster High: Electrified is a family, animation
film directed by Jun Falkenstein.

3
00:11:22,105 --> 00:11:28,105
When Clawdeen dreams of opening a salon made for monsters and normies, Frankie
has the perfect place - an abandoned power station outside town.

4
00:15:09,473 --> 00:15:15,473
But the idea sparks negative voltage when Moanica plots to ruin the whole
thing, and replace the celebration with something a little more...

5
00:18:56,842 --> 00:19:02,842
Luckily the ghouls have a secret weapon on their side...Twyla, the daughter of
the Boogey Man, and the perfect ghoul to unearth any mystery.

6
00:22:44,210 --> 00:22:50,210
Along with the most voltageous salon ever!

7
00:26:31,578 --> 00:26:37,578
So catch every twist, turn, zap and blast...because the
Monster High ghouls are about to get ELECTRIC!

